<title>USA: Ralcorp Holdings to take $20 mln charge.</title>
<headline>Ralcorp Holdings to take $20 mln charge.</headline>
<dateline>NAPLES, Fla. 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ralcorp Holdings Inc said Wednesday it plans to take a one-time charge of $20 million in its current fiscal second quarter.</p>
<p>The charge is related to a reduction in employment and a penalty to break a long-term contract with an information systems supplier.</p>
</text>
